  "solution": {
    "text": "We know that Q.D $=\\frac{5}{6} \\times M \\cdot D .=\\frac{5}{6} \\times 12=10$\r\n\r\n$\\therefore \\mathrm{S} . \\mathrm{D}=\\frac{3}{2} \\times Q \\cdot D .=\\frac{3}{2} \\times 10 \\Rightarrow S . D .=15$"
  }
